OL,3,GNEWSAWolves fan to walk around stadium
OL,4,Afor 60 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has raised more than #470,000
OL,7,Ffor charity has announced plans to walk
OL,8,F150 miles to mark the 150th anniversary
OL,9,Fof his favourite football club
OL,11,FManny Singh Kang said Manny's Molineux
OL,12,F150 pays homage to Wolverhampton
OL,13,FWanderers, which was founded in 1877.
OL,15,FThe avid Wolves supporter has invited
OL,16,Fmembers of the public to join him on
OL,17,Fthe challenge at the Molineux Stadium
OL,18,Fon Waterloo Road, where he will be
OL,19,Fwalking around the grounds for 60 hours
OL,20,Fto cover 150 miles.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
